{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>They shall not dwell in your land.</b> In that portion of the land that you conquer and in which you dwell — they shall not dwell, the opposite of what they did, as he testified in saying: וַיֵּשֶׁב הַכְּנַעֲנִי בְּקִרְבּוֹ בְּגֶזֶר (Judges 1:29), וַיֵּשֶׁב בְּקֶרֶב הַכְּנַעֲנִי יוֹשְׁבֵי הָאָרֶץ (Judges 1:33)." "<b>Lest they become a snare to you.</b> Their dwelling in your land, which will cause you to serve their elohim."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:03.365462393Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}